{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22500","headline":"送张山人归嵩阳 · 白居易","name":"送张山人归嵩阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄昏惨惨天微雪，修行坊西鼓声绝。\n张生马瘦衣且单，夜扣柴门与我别。\n媿君冒寒来别我，爲君酤酒张灯火。\n酒酣火煖与君言，何事入关又出关。\n荅云前年偶下山，四十余月客长安。\n长安古来名利地，空手无金行路难。\n朝游九城陌，肥马轻车欺杀客。\n暮宿五侯门，残茶冷酒愁杀人。\n春明门，门前便是嵩山路。\n幸有云泉容此身，明日辞君且归去。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22500.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22500","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}